#: roudix_store/ui.py
msgid ""
"This writes “roudix.flatpak.enable = true” to your local.nix, then rebuilds "
"the system (a few minutes). The Flathub catalog is then fetched and Roudix "
"Store has to be restarted for Flatpak to be picked up."
msgstr ""
"Esto escribe «roudix.flatpak.enable = true» en tu local.nix y luego "
"reconstruye el sistema (unos minutos). Después se obtiene el catálogo de "
"Flathub y hay que reiniciar Roudix Store para que se detecte Flatpak."

